### ========================================
### ENHANCED FLIGHT SEARCH SYSTEM - TEST FILE
### ========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ========================================
### 1. BASIC SEARCH - Location to Location
### ========================================

### Search flights from Delhi to Mumbai (any date)
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Delhi&to=Mumbai

### Search flights from Mumbai to Bangalore on specific date
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Mumbai&to=Bangalore&date=2025-01-20

### Search using airport codes
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=DEL&to=BOM&date=2025-01-25

### ========================================
### 2. ROUND TRIP SEARCH
### ========================================

### Search round trip: Delhi to Mumbai and back
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Delhi&to=Mumbai&date=2025-01-20&returnDate=2025-01-27

### Round trip with airport codes
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=BLR&to=MAA&date=2025-02-01&returnDate=2025-02-05

### ========================================
### 3. FILTERED SEARCH
### ========================================

### Search with price range filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Delhi&to=Mumbai&date=2025-01-20&minPrice=3000&maxPrice=8000

### Search morning flights only
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Mumbai&to=Bangalore&date=2025-01-20&timeOfDay=morning

### Search afternoon flights
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Delhi&to=Chennai&date=2025-01-20&timeOfDay=afternoon

### Search evening flights
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Bangalore&to=Hyderabad&date=2025-01-20&timeOfDay=evening

### ========================================
### 4. SORTED SEARCH
### ========================================

### Sort by price (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Delhi&to=Mumbai&date=2025-01-20&sortBy=price

### Sort by duration
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Delhi&to=Mumbai&date=2025-01-20&sortBy=duration

### Sort by departure time
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Delhi&to=Mumbai&date=2025-01-20&sortBy=departure

### ========================================
### 5. COMBINED FILTERS
### ========================================

### Morning flights with price range, sorted by price
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Delhi&to=Mumbai&date=2025-01-20&timeOfDay=morning&minPrice=4000&maxPrice=10000&sortBy=price

### Round trip with all filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Delhi&to=Mumbai&date=2025-01-20&returnDate=2025-01-27&timeOfDay=morning&minPrice=5000&maxPrice=15000&sortBy=duration

### ========================================
### 6. ADVANCED SEARCH (by flight number, status)
### ========================================

### Search by flight number
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search-advanced?flightNumber=FL001

### Search by origin and destination
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search-advanced?origin=Delhi&destination=Mumbai

### Search by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search-advanced?status=Scheduled

### Search by departure date
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search-advanced?departure=2025-01-20

### Combined advanced search
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search-advanced?origin=Delhi&destination=Mumbai&departure=2025-01-20&status=Scheduled

### ========================================
### 7. VALIDATION TESTS (Should Return Errors)
### ========================================

### Error: Past date
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Delhi&to=Mumbai&date=2020-01-01

### Error: Return date before departure
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Delhi&to=Mumbai&date=2025-01-20&returnDate=2025-01-15

### Error: Same origin and destination
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?from=Delhi&to=Delhi&date=2025-01-20

### ========================================
### 8. CALCULATE PRICE
### ========================================

### Calculate price for 1 Adult + 1 Child + 1 Infant (One Way)
POST {{baseUrl}}/flights/calculate-price
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightId": 1,
  "passengers": [
    {
      "passengerType": "Adult",
      "seatClass": "Economy",
      "seatNumber": "12A"
    },
    {
      "passengerType": "Child",
      "seatClass": "Economy",
      "seatNumber": "12B"
    },
    {
      "passengerType": "Infant",
      "seatClass": "Economy",
      "seatNumber": "12C"
    }
  ]
}

### Calculate price for Round Trip (2 Adults in Business)
POST {{baseUrl}}/flights/calculate-price
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightId": 1,
  "returnFlightId": 2,
  "passengers": [
    {
      "passengerType": "Adult",
      "seatClass": "Business",
      "seatNumber": "1A"
    },
    {
      "passengerType": "Adult",
      "seatClass": "Business",
      "seatNumber": "1B"
    }
  ]
}

### ========================================
### 9. CHECK SEAT AVAILABILITY
### ========================================

### Get available seats for a specific flight
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/available-seats/1

### ========================================
### 10. AI CHATBOT FLIGHT QUERIES
### ========================================

### Ask chatbot about flights from Delhi to Mumbai
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": 1,
  "message": "Show me flights from Delhi to Mumbai",
  "userId": "test-user-1"
}

### Ask chatbot about flights on specific date
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": 1,
  "message": "Are there any flights from Bangalore to Chennai on January 20th?",
  "userId": "test-user-1"
}

### Ask chatbot about flight prices
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": 1,
  "message": "What are the prices for flights from Delhi to Mumbai?",
  "userId": "test-user-1"
}

### Ask chatbot about available routes
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": 1,
  "message": "What routes are available?",
  "userId": "test-user-1"
}

