#   "returnTrip": { ... }
# }

### ========================================
### FEATURES IMPLEMENTED
### ========================================

# ✅ User-friendly location search (city name or airport code)
# ✅ Round trip search support
# ✅ Price range filtering
# ✅ Time of day filtering (morning/afternoon/evening/night)
# ✅ Multiple sort options (price/duration/departure/arrival)
# ✅ Seat availability display
# ✅ Pricing information in search results
# ✅ Input validation (past dates, invalid date ranges)
# ✅ AI chatbot integration with natural language queries
# ✅ Enhanced response format with all flight details
# ✅ Support for both simple and advanced search

### ========================================
### TIME OF DAY DEFINITIONS
### ========================================

# Morning: 06:00 - 11:59
# Afternoon: 12:00 - 17:59
# Evening: 18:00 - 23:59
# Night: 00:00 - 05:59

### ========================================
### PASSENGER TYPE DISCOUNTS
### ========================================

# Adult: Full price (100%)
# Child (2-11 years): 25% discount (75% of adult price)
# Infant (0-23 months): 90% discount (10% of adult price)
